# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Images — kept OUT of git so pushes/clones stay small & fast.
# These files still live on disk (untracked via `git rm --cached`,
# not deleted) and still deploy via Firebase Hosting from the
# working directory. Past history is untouched.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.png
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.gif
*.webp
*.bmp
*.tiff
*.tif
*.ico

# ── Exceptions: small brand/UI chrome that MUST stay tracked
#    (needed by every page + on a fresh clone). ──
!favicon.ico
!images/favicon-16x16.png
!images/favicon-32x32.png
!images/apple-touch-icon.png
!images/industries/v3/icon-pack/*.png

# NOTE: *.svg is intentionally NOT ignored — SVGs (e.g. images/logo-primary.svg)
# are small, code-like brand assets and stay tracked.

# Local scratch / temp
.tmp/
session 4/ 
